  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Mechanism for Analysis and StrategicSupport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outcome of this project is to increase the use of needs and contextual analysis by humanitarian actors to inform evidence-based decision making and operational response planning in Afghanistan. To achieve this, ACAPS will set up an Afghanistan Analysis Hub led by a Team Leader and supported by a team of analysts based in Afghanistan and remotely. The analysts will work together with other information actors in the response (OCHA, REACH, IOM&#x2019;s DTM, and others) and will sift through existing information in Afghanistan, making use of the wealth of academic, political, development, and sociological data, to develop analytical products which help humanitarian actors with their understanding of key issues and to aid their decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
